      rect 554,279.41266 14x2 fill #ff9b45
      text "Goal" @580,286.59674 #ece6d8 Inter 17
      text "Invoice totals must equal the sum of their rounded lines. Today they drift by up" @554,314.7442 #ece6d8 Inter 14.5
